msgctxt "196_Saejima"
msgid "(Time for some answers...)"
msgstr "(Es hora de unas respuestas...)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About Purgatory
msgctxt "208_Saejima"
msgid "So what's the deal with this Purgatory joint?"
msgstr "Así que, ¿Cuál es el asunto con este antro?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About Purgatory
msgctxt "220_The Florist"
msgid "You know that entertainment area you saw as you came in?"
msgstr "¿Viste el área de entretenimiento cuando entraste?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About Purgatory
msgctxt "232_Saejima"
msgid "Kinda hard to miss."
msgstr "Dificil de ignorar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About Purgatory
msgctxt "244_The Florist"
msgid "Well, I built it myself years ago. What you see, I created."
msgstr "Bueno, yo mismo la construí hace años. Lo que ves, yo lo creé."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "256_The Florist"
msgid "Kamurocho's rich and famous come here from all quarters\\r\nfor a taste of the pleasures they can't get aboveground."
msgstr "Los adinerados y famosos de Kamurocho vienen aqui por una probada\\r\nde los placeres que no se encuentran en la superficie."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "268_The Florist"
msgid "We cater to every taste, no matter how decadent.\\r\nGambling, sex, things of that nature."
msgstr "Nos adaptamos a cada gusto, no importa lo sucios que sean.\\r\nApuestas, sexo, cosas por el estilo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "280_The Florist"
msgid "Normally, potential clients are carefully screened before\\r\nI let them in, though I've made an exception in your case."
msgstr "Normalmente, los clientes son examinados cuidadosamente antes\\r\nde permitirles la entrada, aunque he hecho una excepción en tu caso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "292_The Florist"
msgid "But these pleasures are going to cost you. Just be careful\\r\nthe place doesn't suck you in. Don't forget, you're a man\\r\non a mission."
msgstr "Pero estos placeres cuestan. Cuidado con distraerte.\\r\nNo lo olvides, tienes una misión."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "316_Saejima"
msgid "Folks call you some kinda info broker."
msgstr "La gente dice que das información."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "328_The Florist"
msgid "That they do. I'm a dealer, and the drug I sell is intel."
msgstr "Así es. Soy un traficante y la droga que vendo es información."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "340_The Florist"
msgid "Information on everything that goes down in Kamurocho\\r\neventually reaches my ears, one way or another."
msgstr "Información sobre todo lo que sucede en Kamurocho\\r\neventualmente llega a mi, de una u otra forma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "352_The Florist"
msgid "I have a network of informers at my fingertips\\r\nand surveillance cameras mounted all over town.\\r\nI've got eyes in every nook and cranny."
msgstr "Tengo una red de informantes a la palma de mi mano\\r\ny camaras de vigilancia por toda la ciudad.\\r\nTengo ojos en cada rincón de la ciudad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "400_The Florist"
msgid "You being here means there's something you want to know.\\r\nSomething only I can find out for you."
msgstr "Tu presencia solo significa que quieres saber algo.\\r\nAlgo que solo yo puedo averiguar por ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "412_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. I'm lookin' for Hideki Sasai, Patriarch of the Sasai\\r\nFamily－or at least he was back in '85. Know where he's at?"
msgstr "Sí. Estoy buscando a Hideki Sasai, patriarca de la familia Sasai\\r\nallá por el '85. ¿Sabes dónde está?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=22
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P22
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "424_The Florist"
msgid "I do, but my intel doesn't come cheap."
msgstr "Lo hago, pero mi información no es regalada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=23
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P23
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "436_Saejima"
msgid "Name your price."
msgstr "Di tu precio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=24
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P24
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "448_The Florist"
msgid "Let's say 10 million yen."
msgstr "Podriamos decir 10 millones de yenes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=25
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P25
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "460_Saejima"
msgid "That a joke?"
msgstr "¿Es una broma?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "472_Saejima"
msgid "I ain't holdin' that kinda cash. But you already knew that,\\r\ndidn't ya?"
msgstr "No tengo tanto dinero. Pero ya lo sabías, ¿Verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "484_The Florist"
msgid "Of course. I wouldn't be much of an info dealer\\r\nif I didn't. But you do have another option.\\r\nThere's something you can do for me instead."
msgstr "Por supuesto. Si no, no sería informante.\\r\nPero no tienes otra opción. Quiero que hagas algo por mi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=28
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P28
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "496_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah? Let's hear it."
msgstr "Sí, oigámoslas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=29
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P29
#. y4:msg_speaker=The Florist
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
#. y4:msg_choice_index=2
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Ask About the Florist
msgctxt "508_The Florist"
msgid "Heh... Follow me."
msgstr "Claro. Sígueme."

